OL,3,ASupporters of jailed ex-PM Imran Khan
OL,4,Abegin march in Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of supporters of Pakistan's
OL,7,Fjailed ex-prime minister Imran Khan
OL,8,Fhave begun a march from the country's
OL,9,Fnorth-west as they call for his
OL,10,Frelease.
OL,12,FConcerns over the 74-year-old's health
OL,13,Fhave grown louder in recent months. His
OL,14,Ffamily claims he has lost most of his
OL,15,Fvision in his right eye after prison
OL,16,Fauthorities failed to take action.
OL,18,FThe cricket star-turned-politician, who
OL,19,Ffaces charges in more than 100 cases,
OL,20,Fwas jailed for 17 years over corruption
OL,21,Flast year. Khan said all the cases
OL,22,Fagainst him are politically motivated.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
